It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original author. Original
copyright and MIT license terms are preserved in LICENSE.

Original project: https://github.com/thlorenz/cardinal

The package preserves the dependency keys ansicolors and redeyed through exact
npm aliases to maintained @stackline/ansicolors@1.0.1 and
@stackline/redeyed@1.0.2. Redeyed resolves its Esprima-compatible parser to
maintained @stackline/esprima@1.0.0. Browser bundles include code from those
projects. Their redistribution terms are preserved in
